ORDINANCE - Pursuant to Section 2.2.1, Zoning Map Amendments, Section 5.1.2, Zoning
Districts Established, and Section 5.1.3, Official Zoning Map, of the Cheyenne Unified Development
Code, changing the zoning classification from MR-2 Medium Density Residential-Developing to
MUB Mixed-Use Business Emphasis for a replat of a portion of Tract 5, Storey Acres, Cheyenne,
Wyoming, to be known as RKRR Addition (located west of and adjacent to Townsend Place, south
of Arbor Lane).  Reporting for Public Services Committee, Mr. Cook moved to approve on third and
final reading, seconded by Ms. Williams.  Motion carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members of the
governing body.
ORDINANCE - 1 Reading - Annexing to the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, a parcel of land
