5.1.2, Zoning Districts Established, and Section 5.1.3, Official Zoning Map, of the Cheyenne Unified
Development Code, changing the zoning classification from County MR Medium Density
Residential to MR-2 Medium Density Residential-Developing for Lots 1, 8, and 9, Block 5; Lots 1-4,
